## How I use it
- **Pathway:** P7 — the [[Fat Loss Pathways (Theory)#pathway-7--the-counter-regulatory-wall-cortisol--hpa-axis|cortisol / HPA wall]]. Clinically blunts the ACTH→cortisol response to acute stress.
- **Slot:** **21:30 pre-bed** in [[Fat Loss Daily Schedule (Cut)]] — drops the day's stimulant + trenbolone stress load so the system shifts parasympathetic and reaches deep slow-wave sleep.
- **Why it matters on a cut:** chronic cortisol drives visceral fat retention, leptin resistance (down-regulating T4→T3), and sub-Q water that masks visual progress. PS is the supplement arm; [[Oxandrolone (Anavar) (10mg×100tab) — kohohpharma|Oxandrolone]] is the pharmacological glucocorticoid block.
- **Substitute:** [[Ashwagandha (600mg×120tab) — iHerb|Ashwagandha]] (already in stock) covers the same slot more cheaply; PS is the cleaner, more targeted ACTH blunter when budget allows. Run **one**, not both.

